sequenceDiagram
  participant R as refreshActivePlugins
  participant C as caches/loader
  participant A as AppState
  participant L as LSP manager
  participant H as Hook registry
  R->>C: clearAllCaches
  R->>C: await loadAllPlugins
  par cache-only consumers
    R->>C: getPluginCommands
    R->>C: getAgentDefinitions
  end
  R->>C: warm MCP/LSP descriptors
  R->>A: setAppState + reconnect key
  R->>L: reinitialize
  R->>H: clear and register Hooks
